// symlinks and ".." exactly as a kernel path walk would, until the first
// component that cannot be Lstat'd. The remaining literal components — a
// data directory Open is about to create, or parents of it — are appended
// unchanged. The returned path is absolute and lexically clean; on success
// every existing component names the same physical entry root does.
